    "privacyNotice": {
      "default": "\u003Cp\u003EAsante kwa kushiriki maoni yako.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMaoni yako yatatusaidia kuboresha BBC News Swahili na kutengeneza maudhui yanayokufaa zaidi na kuwa yenye manufaa kwako.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EKwa kubofya 'Tuma', unakubaliana na \u003Ca href=\"https://www.bbc.com/swahili/taasisi-37098622\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ESheria na Masharti ya Matumizi\u003C/a\u003E. Unaweza pia kusoma \u003Ca href=\"https://www.bbc.com/swahili/taasisi-37100010\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ETaarifa yetu ya Faragha\u003C/a\u003E ili kupata maelezo kuhusu jinsi BBC World Service inavyotumia maoni yako na kushughulikia taarifa zako binafsi.\u003C/p\u003E",
